				<p>Koivulandia on FabiCraftin survivalissa sijaitseva kylä (<a	href="fabicraft.net" target="_blank">fabicraft.net</a>)</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-zinc-700 p-4 rounded-lg">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Milloin Koivulandia Kokoontuu?</h2>
				<p>
					Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit.
					Harum amet at, corporis facere perferendis eligendi
					voluptates? Vitae consequuntur tenetur nemo, asperiores
					saepe in, blanditiis animi totam ad eveniet, eum illum!
